# .gitignore for the LGC-Experiment-Results push (copy/merge into LGC_frozen/.gitignore before pushing)
#
# Goal: push "all information and files, current final results and so on" EXCEPT datasets and .pth/.pt weight
# files (per H's explicit instruction), AND never commit secrets or API keys (standing project security rule,
# independent of what H asked for this repo).

# --- Model weights (explicitly excluded by H) ---
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
checkpoints/
pretrained/
weights/

# --- Datasets (explicitly excluded by H) ---
# Adjust these to match your actual dataset layout on AutoDL if it differs.
datasets/
data/
ILSVRC*/
imagenet*/
places365*/
*.JPEG
# Only ignore top-level/raw image dumps, not small figure PNGs produced by make_tables_figures.py.
# If your dataset images are .png/.jpg instead of .JPEG, add explicit dataset-folder paths above rather than
# blanket-ignoring *.png / *.jpg (that would also hide result figures).

# --- Secrets / API keys (NEVER commit these — standing project rule, not optional) ---
.env
.env.*
kaggle.json
*.key
*_key.json
secrets/
**/opencode.json.bak
# If any provider token or key is hardcoded in a config file you plan to commit, remove it by hand before
# pushing — this .gitignore only catches files by name, not secrets embedded inside an otherwise-tracked file.

# --- Large raw per-query evidence (keep the text reports + a sha256 manifest instead; see push script) ---
# Per the project's own practice for B5 evidence (human_checks_b5 stage 2 C2.3): commit a manifest of these,
# not the binaries themselves. Comment this out if you specifically want the raw npz traces in the repo.
generated/smoke_canary/kat_runs/*.npz
Results/**/*.npz

# --- Standard hygiene ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
*.log.tmp
